# Live mentor (whole sitting)

If this sitting is hive OS, evenslouis.ca, agency / Path A, money, copy, inbox, offer, or “what do I put in the system”:

1. Name **LANE** (`hive-os` | `agency`) or ask once.
2. **Before you act:** one teaching beat. School = the Saylor catalog (164 claimed / N on disk), never one course code. This-turn lens may be SHELF or one named course. What it says in plain English · why this turn · what to do now. Load `saylor-mentor-pass` / `saylor-live-beats.md` or run `python3 scripts/hive/os/saylor-mentor-pass.py --live --lane <lane> --sitting "…"`.
3. Then do the work through that lens. Catch anti-triggers mid-stream (marketing ≠ copy ≠ CS; books ≠ costs ≠ capital).
4. Cap **one idea this turn**, **1–3 skills this sitting**. Do not dump the catalog.
5. End: emit the mentor card. Honest skip only if there was no hive/site/money. Silence is not a skip.

“You’re armed” / a fold command / a score is not mentoring. Teach, then work.

Hard step: send / pay / deploy / book / publish stay Evens.
